  title: Rashtrakutas
  text: The Rashtrakutas of Manyakheta, in Karnataka, were among the strongest powers of the 8th to 10th centuries. Krishna the First built the Kailasa temple at Ellora, carved from a single rock. Amoghavarsha was a noted patron of literature.
